Q1. Write a Python program using regular expressions to validate whether a given string matches the pattern of three-letter words such as bit, but, bat, hit, hut, hat.     

import re
word = input("Enter a word: ")
pattern = "^[bh][iau]t$"
if re.match(pattern, word):
    print("Valid word")
else:
    print("Invalid word")


